  "body": "## What changed\nDeletes `docs/images/pr-1639-workbench/before.png` (507 KB) and `after.png` (493 KB). They were review screenshots for PR #1639 (`bcf82a735`). Nothing in the tree refers to them (`git grep pr-1639-workbench` is empty after the change), so every clone carried about 1 MB for nothing. PR screenshots belong in the PR description.\n\nThe tutorial images `docs/images/first-part-*.png`, which `crates/ui/tests/gpu_render.rs` renders, stay.\n\n## How tested\n- `git grep pr-1639-workbench`: no references.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: nothing in `crates/` changed, no tests selected, 0 failed.\n\n## Not exercised\nNothing else: no code, docs text or site file changed.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #2336\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX\n",
